{"sections":[{"slug":"Steenrod运算","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Steenrod运算"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Steenrod <span lang=\"zh\">运算</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Steenrod 运算”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $\\mathbb F_2$-<span lang=\"zh\">链复形</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">或</span> $\\mathbb F_2$-<span lang=\"zh\">模谱</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">上的函子</span> $D_2=(-)^{\\otimes 2}_{h\\Sigma_2}$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $V$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\mathbb F_2$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的链复形</span>, $v\\in H^nV$ <span lang=\"zh\">由映射</span> $\\eta\\colon \\mathbb F_2[-n]\\to V$ <span lang=\"zh\">表示</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">以</span> $D_2$ <span lang=\"zh\">作用之</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">得到</span>\n$$\r\nD_2(\\mathbb F_2[-n]) \\to D_2(V),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">注意到</span> $H^*D_2(\\mathbb F_2[-n])\\simeq H_{2n-*}(\\mathbb{R}P^\\infty ,\\mathbb F_2)$. Steenrod <span lang=\"zh\">运算</span> $\\mathrm {Sq}^iv$ <span lang=\"zh\">是这个映射下</span> $H_{*}(\\mathbb RP^\\infty ,\\mathbb F_2)$ <span lang=\"zh\">生成元的像</span>.</p>\n"}}}]}